The information in this section gives an overview of the processes involved in administering this qualification. All
of the following processes require you to submit something to OCR by a specific deadline. More information about
the processes and deadlines involved at each stage of the assessment cycle can be found in the Administration
area of the OCR website.

7.1  Assessment availability

There are two assessment series available each year in January and June to all students. Students can be entered
for different units in different assessment series. All students must take the exam at a set time on the same day in a
series. Certification (where students achieve the qualification) is available each January and June.

