□	 The Olympic and Paralympic values:

	 The Olympic values of Excellence, Friendship

and Respect

To include:
•	 Know the Creed - “The most important thing is not
to win but to take part, just as the most important
thing in life is not the triumph but the struggle. The
essential thing is not to have conquered, but to
have fought well”. Pierre De Coubertin

	 The Paralympic values of Courage,

•	 Know the that the five interlocking rings represent

Determination, Inspiration and Equality

the closeness between the five continents

•	 Know the that the five interlocking rings represent

