+    "find": "Cost overruns are almost universal in Olympic host cities: the Paris 2024 organising committee budget reached around &euro;4.48 billion, while total French state spending including infrastructure and security came to roughly &euro;6.6 billion according to the French Court of Auditors&rsquo; 2025 report. Taxpayers bear most of this gap.",
